{"path":"language/nullptr","title":"Predefined null pointer constant (since C23)","titleHtml":"Predefined null pointer constant <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/language/nullptr","section":"language","kind":"page","summary":"The keyword nullptr denotes a predefined null pointer constant. It is a non-lvalue of type nullptr_t. nullptr can be converted to a pointer types or bool, where the result is the null pointer value of that type or false respectively.","html":"<h3 id=\"Syntax\">Syntax</h3>\n<table class=\"t-sdsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-sdsc\">\n<td> <code><b>nullptr</b></code>\n</td>\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\">\n</td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Explanation\">Explanation</h3>\n<p>The keyword <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">nullptr</span></code> denotes a predefined null pointer constant. It is a <a href=\"/w/c/language/value_category#Non-lvalue_object_expressions\">non-lvalue</a> of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/types/nullptr_t\">nullptr_t</a></span>. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">nullptr</span></code> can be <a href=\"/w/c/language/conversion\">converted</a> to a pointer types or <span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">bool</span>, where the result is the null pointer value of that type or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> respectively.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Keywords\">Keywords</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/w/c/keyword/nullptr\"><code>nullptr</code></a>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>Demonstrates that a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">nullptr</span></code> can also be used as a null pointer constant.</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stddef.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> g<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/puts\"><span class=\"kw836\">puts</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Function g called\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co2\">#define DETECT_NULL_POINTER_CONSTANT(e) \\\n    _Generic(e,                         \\\n        void*&nbsp;: puts(\"void*\"),          \\\n        nullptr_t&nbsp;: puts(\"nullptr_t\"),  \\\n        default&nbsp;: puts(\"integer\")       \\\n    )</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    g<span class=\"br0\">(</span>nullptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// OK</span>\n    g<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/types/NULL\"><span class=\"kw103\">NULL</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// OK</span>\n    g<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// OK</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> cloned_nullptr <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> nullptr<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    g<span class=\"br0\">(</span>cloned_nullptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// OK</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>maybe_unused<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> cloned_NULL <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/c/types/NULL\"><span class=\"kw103\">NULL</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//  g(cloned_NULL); // implementation-defined: maybe OK</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>maybe_unused<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> cloned_zero <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//  g(cloned_zero); // Error</span>\n&nbsp;\n    DETECT_NULL_POINTER_CONSTANT<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    DETECT_NULL_POINTER_CONSTANT<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    DETECT_NULL_POINTER_CONSTANT<span class=\"br0\">(</span>nullptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    DETECT_NULL_POINTER_CONSTANT<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/types/NULL\"><span class=\"kw103\">NULL</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// implementation-defined</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Function g called\nFunction g called\nFunction g called\nFunction g called\nvoid*\ninteger\nnullptr_t\nvoid*</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-23\">\n<ul><li> C23 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 6.4.4.6 Predefined constants (p: 66)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/types/NULL\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>NULL</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   implementation-defined null pointer constant <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(macro constant)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/types/nullptr_t\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>nullptr_t</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(C23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   the type of the predefined null pointer constant <strong class=\"selflink\"><code>nullptr</code></strong>  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(typedef)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/nullptr\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>nullptr</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Syntax","id":"Syntax"},{"depth":3,"text":"Explanation","id":"Explanation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Keywords","id":"Keywords"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"language","title":"C language"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"Predefined null pointer constant (since C23)","children":[{"label":"Syntax"},{"label":"Explanation","note":"The keyword nullptr denotes a predefined null pointer constant."},{"label":"Keywords","note":"nullptr"},{"label":"Example","note":"Demonstrates that a copy of nullptr can also be used as a null pointer constant."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"NULL","note":"implementation-defined null pointer constant"},{"label":"nullptr_t","note":"the type of the predefined null pointer constant nullptr"}]}]},"standards":["C23"],"wordCount":190,"codeBlockCount":2}
